### Register BodyComposition for an Evaluation
POST {{baseUrl}}/evaluations/{{evaluationId}}/body-composition
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "weightKg": 71.0,
  "heightM": 1.65,
  "bmi": 26.1,
  "bodyFatPercentage": 27.5,
  "muscleMassPercentage": 35.0
}

###

### Get BodyComposition for an Evaluation
GET {{baseUrl}}/evaluations/{{evaluationId}}/body-composition
